Package: randomGaussian
Title: Sampling from the Gaussian Distribution
Version: 0.9.3
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Ivan Jacob Agaloos",
           family = "Pesigan",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "r.jeksterslab@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4818-8420"))
Description: Random variates from the multivariate Gaussian distribution
    using the Cholesky, eigen, or singular value decomposition of the
    covariance matrix.
    The internal functions have no input checks and are copied by other
    projects.
URL: https://github.com/ijapesigan/randomGaussian, https://ijapesigan.github.io/randomGaussian/
